#: 787e61243a4d48eca71d21377d7b5bc8 of
#: pybroker.scope.sym_exec_dates_from_store:3
msgid ""
"Symbols are walked in sorted order. :attr:`SymbolArrayStore.symbols` is a"
" ``frozenset[str]``, so iterating it directly would seed this mapping in "
"string-hash order, and that order decides which symbol is served first on"
" each bar when calendars are ragged -- making a capital-constrained "
"backtest depend on ``PYTHONHASHSEED``. Sorting also matches the "
"``sorted(test_syms)`` order the aligned-calendar path already uses."
msgstr ""

